1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:25,782 --> 00:01:29,043
Th-These are Kaido's!

20
00:01:29,043 --> 00:01:30,260
I see now!

21
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:32,434
I can take hold of them,
as I too am a dragon!

22
00:01:41,217 --> 00:01:43,000
Even if I cannot push it back...

23
00:01:43,435 --> 00:01:46,217
If I can at least halt it....

24
00:01:49,174 --> 00:01:52,608
...or change its direction...!

25
00:01:54,217 --> 00:01:57,782
If I do not do something, who will?!

26
00:01:57,782 --> 00:01:59,217
Who?!

27
00:01:59,782 --> 00:02:02,521
I shall save my Land of Wano!

28
00:02:03,347 --> 00:02:10,043
I will not let this island
fall upon the Flower Capital!

29
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,478
Sparking...

30
00:02:13,913 --> 00:02:15,913
...Queen!

31
00:02:20,043 --> 00:02:21,477
Beams from his eyes?!

32
00:02:22,435 --> 00:02:23,608
Don't tell me...!

33
00:02:40,826 --> 00:02:42,826
Is everyone all right?

34
00:02:42,826 --> 00:02:43,565
Yes...

35
00:02:43,565 --> 00:02:45,347
Staying here is too dangerous!

36
00:02:45,347 --> 00:02:46,912
Let us retreat further from here!

37
00:02:50,086 --> 00:02:51,173
Chuji is gone!

38
00:02:51,174 --> 00:02:52,130
Eh?

39
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:54,086
He wasn't caught
in the blast, was he...?

40
00:02:54,086 --> 00:02:57,173
We must leave!
There could be another blast soon!

41
00:02:58,739 --> 00:02:59,869
I...

42
00:03:05,174 --> 00:03:09,565
I can't leave without him!

43
00:03:09,565 --> 00:03:11,999
O-Some!

44
00:03:13,174 --> 00:03:14,695
Henry...

45
00:03:16,565 --> 00:03:19,043
...Queen!

46
00:03:41,347 --> 00:03:43,521
Was that one of Niji's moves?

47
00:03:44,957 --> 00:03:48,217
Right on the money, Vinsmoke!

48
00:03:54,347 --> 00:03:55,564
Escape this!

49
00:04:02,043 --> 00:04:04,564
How d'ya like them apples?!

50
00:04:04,565 --> 00:04:07,912
I did thorough research
on Germa's technology!

51
00:04:07,957 --> 00:04:11,913
I can copy you
'n your siblings' moves!

52
00:04:14,869 --> 00:04:17,391
Would ya quit
lumping me in with them?!

53
00:04:17,391 --> 00:04:22,956
I was plannin' to show 'em off
after you transformed!

54
00:04:25,565 --> 00:04:30,912
If I give ya a beatdown while you're in the suit,
I could prove to Judge...

55
00:04:30,913 --> 00:04:34,782
...that I'm the better scientist!

56
00:04:34,782 --> 00:04:38,043
Like I friggin' care about
whatever's going on between you two!

57
00:04:38,696 --> 00:04:41,696
Don't be so mean!

58
00:04:44,347 --> 00:04:47,390
Winch Queen!

59
00:05:00,478 --> 00:05:02,304
Bet ya felt that, didn't ya?!

60
00:05:02,304 --> 00:05:05,695
I guess you were familiar
with that one, too!

61
00:05:18,174 --> 00:05:20,000
My arm!

62
00:05:23,304 --> 00:05:26,173
Why, you...
you damned brat!

63
00:05:27,521 --> 00:05:29,043
I warned you...

64
00:05:30,304 --> 00:05:33,825
Don't mention their names
in front of me!

65
00:05:34,913 --> 00:05:38,261
Oh, so there's no such thing
as freedom of speech anymore?!

66
00:05:39,782 --> 00:05:42,217
And another thing...

67
00:05:42,217 --> 00:05:45,956
Suit or no suit,
the only thing here getting a beatdown...

68
00:05:48,869 --> 00:05:50,260
...is you!

69
00:05:54,826 --> 00:05:55,956
Flanchet...

70
00:05:58,391 --> 00:05:59,913
...Strike!

71
00:06:12,435 --> 00:06:15,304
Think you still got the upper hand?

72
00:06:16,130 --> 00:06:20,521
Looks like somebody forgot
I sent 'em flying earlier...!

73
00:06:20,521 --> 00:06:23,347
Pretty damn sure you felt that one!

74
00:06:23,347 --> 00:06:27,260
We've been at this for a while...
You gotta be getting weaker!

75
00:06:28,478 --> 00:06:32,435
Laugh at me all ya want, Queen.

76
00:06:32,957 --> 00:06:34,087
I've...

77
00:06:35,217 --> 00:06:38,652
...already accepted my fate.

78
00:06:39,869 --> 00:06:42,173
I'm not the same guy
from back there!

79
00:06:46,391 --> 00:06:48,478
Your weak ass...

80
00:06:49,130 --> 00:06:51,565
...can't take me down!

81
00:06:56,086 --> 00:06:58,912
How d'ya like it?
Here's your technique!

82
00:06:58,913 --> 00:07:00,696
Stealth Black!

83
00:07:01,608 --> 00:07:03,825
So you can do even that...

84
00:07:06,826 --> 00:07:07,695
This is it!

85
00:07:07,696 --> 00:07:11,913
Your backside's totally
wide open, Vinsmoke!

86
00:07:14,347 --> 00:07:16,695
Wha-?! He disappeared too!

87
00:07:19,826 --> 00:07:22,217
But he doesn't have the suit!

88
00:07:22,217 --> 00:07:25,260
He's just movin' too fast to see!

89
00:07:28,782 --> 00:07:32,999
He'll eventually run out of energy
and show himself!

90
00:07:35,435 --> 00:07:37,521
What a dumb tactic!

91
00:07:43,782 --> 00:07:45,695
What's with the mouse here?

92
00:07:46,478 --> 00:07:47,913
Chuji!

93
00:07:47,913 --> 00:07:49,608
You're all right!

94
00:07:49,608 --> 00:07:50,738
Hurry, now!

95
00:07:51,696 --> 00:07:55,000
We don't know when
they will start fighting again.

96
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,565
O-Some!

97
00:07:56,565 --> 00:07:59,695
I can't believe
that tramp's still moving!

98
00:08:10,478 --> 00:08:13,913
Where'd you go, Vinsmoke?

99
00:08:18,217 --> 00:08:21,565
I am not Kaido's subordinate!

100
00:08:21,565 --> 00:08:25,086
am just a geisha,
brought in from the Flower Capital!

101
00:08:25,086 --> 00:08:28,477
O-Some! What is she doing here?!

102
00:08:28,478 --> 00:08:33,869
That wench... She turned me down today,
sayin' she was laid up in bed with a headache...

103
00:08:33,869 --> 00:08:37,130
But she looks full o' energy to me!

104
00:08:37,130 --> 00:08:39,739
Here I was, tryin' to be all nice
'n a good customer to her,

105
00:08:39,739 --> 00:08:43,086
and she gets all uppity on me! Dammit!

106
00:08:43,086 --> 00:08:45,782
Playin' me for a fool!

107
00:08:49,304 --> 00:08:54,608
Now that Komurasaki-tan's gone,
you're my number one!

108
00:08:55,174 --> 00:08:56,956
You're not gettin' off easy...

109
00:08:56,957 --> 00:09:02,086
for lying to me and turning me
down who knows how many times!

110
00:09:02,086 --> 00:09:03,521
This is divine punishment!

111
00:09:04,347 --> 00:09:06,260
Please let me go!

112
00:09:15,435 --> 00:09:18,782
Poetic justice.
Cause and effect.

113
00:09:18,782 --> 00:09:20,869
It's Johnny Obviouson!

114
00:09:21,260 --> 00:09:23,782
This is punishment!

115
00:09:31,913 --> 00:09:34,696
Seems like you need more pain, O-Some!

116
00:09:34,696 --> 00:09:37,782
If you're still not sorry
for what you did...

117
00:09:45,608 --> 00:09:47,738
What I gained...

118
00:09:47,739 --> 00:09:48,913
An exoskeleton...

119
00:09:48,913 --> 00:09:49,913
Muscular strength...

120
00:09:49,913 --> 00:09:51,608
And mobility...

121
00:09:51,608 --> 00:09:54,173
They're just extra tools in my toolbox...

122
00:09:56,826 --> 00:10:00,652
By coating my exoskeleton
in finely-forged Color of Arms...

123
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:06,130
I can cover my leg in
tougher, hotter flames!

124
00:10:07,347 --> 00:10:09,782
Ifrit Jambe!

125
00:10:09,782 --> 00:10:12,173
More acceleration! More weight!

126
00:10:12,174 --> 00:10:13,652
And the mystery is solved!

127
00:10:14,217 --> 00:10:16,652
Men should never hit women!

128
00:10:17,696 --> 00:10:20,782
That's been common sense
since the age of dinosaurs!

129
00:10:21,217 --> 00:10:23,695
It was you, wasn't it, Queen?!

130
00:10:23,739 --> 00:10:26,522
You piece of crap!
Collier!

131
00:10:36,217 --> 00:10:38,391
What?! Queen-sama?!

132
00:10:38,478 --> 00:10:40,739
Don't worry!
Leave him to me!

133
00:10:40,739 --> 00:10:42,522
O-Okay!

134
00:10:45,782 --> 00:10:49,217
Vinsmoke Sanji!

135
00:10:57,478 --> 00:10:58,913
Basses Côte!

136
00:11:00,347 --> 00:11:01,043
Paleron!

137
00:11:03,608 --> 00:11:05,434
Jumeau à Bifteck!

138
00:11:06,130 --> 00:11:07,782
Tendron!
Flanchet!

139
00:11:07,869 --> 00:11:10,217
Queue!
Poire! Jarret!

140
00:11:25,652 --> 00:11:29,478
Germa, Germa, Germa!

141
00:11:29,478 --> 00:11:32,260
That power is so Germa!

142
00:11:32,260 --> 00:11:34,260
Shut the hell up, dammit!

143
00:11:34,260 --> 00:11:38,173
That name has nothing
to do with me now!

144
00:11:41,608 --> 00:11:44,565
I haven't applied
my garnish to you yet!

145
00:11:44,608 --> 00:11:47,217
I can turn even meat scraps
into delicious food!

146
00:11:47,217 --> 00:11:49,565
Bring it on, Queen the Plague!

147
00:11:49,608 --> 00:11:53,043
Shut your hole!
My science is number one in the world!

148
00:11:53,086 --> 00:11:56,260
And I'm gonna wipe out
the competition all at once!

149
00:12:10,347 --> 00:12:12,564
Boeuf Burst!

150
00:12:23,217 --> 00:12:25,652
Lift-off, asshat!

151
00:12:58,347 --> 00:12:59,825
Don't worry.

152
00:12:59,826 --> 00:13:01,347
He looks unhurt.

153
00:13:01,347 --> 00:13:04,434
Chuji! I'm so relieved!

154
00:13:04,435 --> 00:13:06,086
He was in danger, so...

155
00:13:06,086 --> 00:13:08,303
Th-Thank you!

156
00:13:15,086 --> 00:13:18,564
He was making food for mice again!

157
00:13:22,521 --> 00:13:24,347
Don't leave her side, now.

158
00:13:27,478 --> 00:13:28,391
How's...

159
00:13:29,347 --> 00:13:32,564
How's your...

160
00:13:32,565 --> 00:13:33,999
...wound...

161
00:13:35,304 --> 00:13:36,825
Are you all right?!

162
00:13:36,826 --> 00:13:39,304
Somebody!
Bring the first-aid kit, hurry!

163
00:13:42,696 --> 00:13:46,869
Our mother protected her child
at the risk of her own life,

164
00:13:46,869 --> 00:13:49,304
and he was born with
the spark of humanity.

165
00:13:50,826 --> 00:13:52,478
That's why you're...

166
00:13:53,478 --> 00:13:55,521
...kinder than anyone else!

167
00:13:57,478 --> 00:14:01,826
Battle of the Pleasure Hall,
Left-Brain Tower, Skull Dome...

168
00:14:03,304 --> 00:14:04,564
Winner:

169
00:14:05,565 --> 00:14:06,999
Sanji.

170
00:14:19,086 --> 00:14:21,043
That's what I thought...

171
00:14:21,043 --> 00:14:24,695
When the flames on his back go out,
he gets faster...

172
00:14:25,652 --> 00:14:28,304
...but his defense drops!

173
00:14:32,913 --> 00:14:35,174
King-sama's mask...

174
00:14:35,174 --> 00:14:37,869
So the rumor was true!

175
00:14:38,435 --> 00:14:42,521
Black wings, white hair, brown skin...

176
00:14:44,130 --> 00:14:46,869
The Government'll give you
a hundred million berries for info!

177
00:14:46,869 --> 00:14:47,999
'He's one of the mythical....

178
00:14:49,043 --> 00:14:50,564
N-No, I mean...

179
00:14:50,565 --> 00:14:52,521
Imperial Flaming Wings!

180
00:14:58,913 --> 00:15:02,130
The castle's already burning, ya know...

181
00:15:02,130 --> 00:15:06,217
You oughta try bein' a little nicer
to your underlings, if you call yourself their boss.

182
00:15:09,217 --> 00:15:12,565
If they're distracting you,
why not come up here?

183
00:15:12,565 --> 00:15:15,086
A hundred mil,
just for givin' the Government info?

184
00:15:16,217 --> 00:15:18,956
What the hell are you, anyway?

185
00:15:26,608 --> 00:15:29,173
Why ask, when you're
already a dead man?!

186
00:15:56,913 --> 00:16:00,304
He's definitely a unique breed,

187
00:16:00,957 --> 00:16:03,304
but what he is doesn't matter to me!

188
00:16:04,391 --> 00:16:07,174
Don't got much time...

189
00:16:09,652 --> 00:16:14,869
If this drags on for too long,
my sword's likely gonna be the end of me.

190
00:16:15,304 --> 00:16:17,956
I see now the danger you pose.

191
00:16:20,217 --> 00:16:21,869
Same to you.

192
00:16:22,217 --> 00:16:24,869
Your reign's gone on long enough.

193
00:16:24,869 --> 00:16:27,434
Time to clear you all
off the throne!

194
00:16:29,217 --> 00:16:30,913
Don't push your luck!

195
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:34,304
Kaido-san will be the Pirate King!

196
00:16:35,869 --> 00:16:38,999
Hate to tell ya,
but that ain't happenin'.

197
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,478
Judge of the Afterlife,

198
00:16:47,565 --> 00:16:49,173
Three-Sword Style:

199
00:16:55,391 --> 00:16:56,739
Purgatory...

200
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:01,391
...Demon Slash!

201
00:17:22,608 --> 00:17:25,565
It was you that gave me this life...

202
00:17:25,957 --> 00:17:27,261
...Kaido-san.

203
00:17:29,174 --> 00:17:33,304
I see why the Government
can't let you go...

204
00:17:33,304 --> 00:17:35,999
You're a Lunarian, aren't ya?

205
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:39,870
I saw the durability test earlier.

206
00:17:45,391 --> 00:17:50,087
I'm gettin' out of here and
putting together a new pirate crew.

207
00:17:51,521 --> 00:17:54,130
What do you wanna do,
guinea pig?

208
00:18:02,826 --> 00:18:06,695
Make a not-so-fun world fun!

209
00:18:06,696 --> 00:18:09,869
Choose! I'll let you decide!

210
00:18:12,696 --> 00:18:14,304
Can you change...

211
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:18,043
...the world?!

212
00:18:19,696 --> 00:18:22,348
I'm the only one that can!

213
00:18:30,608 --> 00:18:32,608
Escaped subjects spotted!

214
00:18:32,608 --> 00:18:34,608
Stop them at any cost!

215
00:18:34,608 --> 00:18:36,869
I'm gonna blow their heads off!

216
00:18:40,435 --> 00:18:41,739
Not much of a pursuit...

217
00:18:41,739 --> 00:18:44,608
Yeah, looks that way.

218
00:18:44,608 --> 00:18:45,956
Fire!

219
00:18:52,217 --> 00:18:54,174
Nothing...
Our guns don't work on them!

220
00:18:59,608 --> 00:19:01,695
Not too shabby!

221
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,000
It's nothing.

222
00:19:12,304 --> 00:19:14,869
Oh, I haven't asked you!

223
00:19:14,869 --> 00:19:16,130
What's your name?

224
00:19:16,957 --> 00:19:18,043
Alber.

225
00:19:18,043 --> 00:19:21,173
Alber! You're strong!

226
00:19:21,913 --> 00:19:25,435
From now on, call yourself "King"!

227
00:19:26,957 --> 00:19:28,435
King...

228
00:19:28,435 --> 00:19:31,347
Stick with me, King!

229
00:19:31,347 --> 00:19:33,477
I won't sell you out!

230
00:19:33,478 --> 00:19:36,565
You're my right-hand man from now on!

231
00:19:50,217 --> 00:19:52,869
The world needs but one king!

232
00:19:53,217 --> 00:19:56,391
His flames are burning...
Attacking now is pointless!

233
00:19:57,174 --> 00:19:59,391
Take this, Roronoa!

234
00:20:00,478 --> 00:20:02,695
Imperial Flaming Wings!

235
00:20:15,608 --> 00:20:17,608
His flames're basically magma!

236
00:20:50,478 --> 00:20:51,521
Doing that again?!

237
00:20:56,217 --> 00:20:59,826
You're not takin
my swords from me!

238
00:21:24,174 --> 00:21:26,347
He's speedy! Which means...

239
00:21:26,782 --> 00:21:27,826
...l can cut him!

240
00:21:33,869 --> 00:21:35,565
Bird Dance!

241
00:21:56,347 --> 00:21:58,260
Seems like you figured out...

242
00:21:59,130 --> 00:22:00,869
...how I work!

243
00:22:01,478 --> 00:22:02,913
That I did!

244
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:06,826
Finally caught sight
of your own defeat?

245
00:22:25,130 --> 00:22:25,826
Ultra...

246
00:22:27,565 --> 00:22:29,521
... Tiger Hunt!

247
00:22:46,086 --> 00:22:48,260
Why're you tryin' to block?!

248
00:22:48,347 --> 00:22:50,260
This ain't supposed to
work on ya, right?!

249
00:22:50,347 --> 00:22:54,043
Or are you scared of my attack?!

250
00:23:39,347 --> 00:23:43,043
You're biologically incapable of
defeating me!

251
00:23:44,913 --> 00:23:49,174
Ain't anything I hate more in the world
than weak-ass excuses!

252
00:23:50,739 --> 00:23:54,174
I'll remember you as
the bold swordsman you were....!

253
00:23:55,304 --> 00:23:57,390
Lemme carve that into
your memory myself...

254
00:23:59,347 --> 00:24:02,043
...if you live to
remember it, that is!

255
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:08,304
Imperial Flaming Wings!

256
00:24:49,826 --> 00:24:52,521
Judge of the Afterlife,
Three-Sword Serpentine...

257
00:24:56,957 --> 00:24:58,913
103 Mercies!

258
00:25:02,869 --> 00:25:06,782
This is it, Roronoa!

259
00:25:11,000 --> 00:25:13,783
Dragon Damnation!

260
00:25:46,478 --> 00:25:49,565
K-Kaido-san...

261
00:25:50,565 --> 00:25:53,999
You still think so, King?

262
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:56,696
That I'm Joyboy?

263
00:25:56,696 --> 00:26:01,304
The world I'm looking to create
is the world you want?

264
00:26:03,782 --> 00:26:06,130
A legend is a legend.

265
00:26:06,130 --> 00:26:08,739
I don't wish for anything anymore.

266
00:26:09,347 --> 00:26:12,608
You gave me the life I have now.

267
00:26:13,260 --> 00:26:16,173
You must remain the strongest!

268
00:26:17,304 --> 00:26:18,956
I won't lose, either...

269
00:26:20,913 --> 00:26:23,261
I'll make you the Pirate King!

270
00:26:33,565 --> 00:26:40,217
You won't settle for anything less than
the world's greatest swordsman, right?

271
00:26:49,739 --> 00:26:53,652
Until the day I defeat him
and become a master swordsman...

272
00:26:54,260 --> 00:26:58,217
I'll never... be defeated!

273
00:26:59,304 --> 00:27:00,782
Got any problems with that...

274
00:27:01,391 --> 00:27:03,217
Pirate King?!

275
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:05,826
Nope!

276
00:27:08,130 --> 00:27:10,565
I'll become...

277
00:27:14,260 --> 00:27:16,434
...the king of hell!

278
00:27:33,696 --> 00:27:37,609
Battle of Right-Brain Tower,
outside the Skull Dome...

279
00:27:43,565 --> 00:27:44,782
Winner:

280
00:27:46,174 --> 00:27:47,000
Zoro!